Package: mudi-screen
Version: @VERSION@-1
Depends: libc
Source: MudiScreen
License: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
Section: utils
Architecture: aarch64_cortex-a53
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: A new user interface for the GL.iNet Mudi 7 touchscreen, with apps.
 Replaces GL.iNet's gl_screen: lock screen with the passcode, network,
 battery and power, and cards and pages of apps (manifest + any program that
 prints JSON). Switch with mudi-screen-mode custom|stock.
